        <mxCell id="YQTk61AZi4meD-gOjFp8-9" value="VOLTAR" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" parent="YQTk61AZi4meD-gOjFp8-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="49" y="5" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="YQTk61AZi4meD-gOjFp8-11" value="&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;1. Cancelamento do pedido:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt; - Deve haver uma opção clara para o cliente cancelar o pedido de portabilidade a qualquer momento antes da liquidação.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt; - Se o cliente desistir, a instituição proponente deve comunicar a desistência à instituição credora.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; min-height: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;2. Manutenção do contrato original:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt; - O contrato original deve permanecer disponível para um novo pedido de portabilidade no futuro após o cancelamento.&lt;/p&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=18;align=left;fillColor=none;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=none;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=5;" parent="YQTk61AZi4meD-gOjFp8-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="374" y="487" width="1045" height="151" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
