        <mxCell id="g_mo_k77u2eWwFpu8na1-3" value="&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW217555778 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;PT-BR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; text-indent: 47px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;&quot;&gt;Para viabilizar a portabilidade de crédito, serão utilizadas APIs de Dados Transacionais para obter o consentimento e acesso aos dados do contrato de empréstimo do cliente, além de serem desenvolvidas APIs específicas para as demais etapas do fluxo. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;spacingLeft=5;fontSize=17;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=1;arcSize=5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
