        <mxCell id="cfFRx8oeBOCocLo1sr69-15" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none;&quot; class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW235835171 BCX0&quot;&gt;O consentimento atual cobre o escopo da portabilidade de crédito, tornando desnecessário&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none;&quot; class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW235835171 BCX0&quot;&gt;a criação de&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none;&quot; class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW235835171 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;consentimento específico. No entanto, será exigida uma formalização específica para validar o pedido de portabilidade de crédito.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;spacingLeft=5;fontSize=22;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=1;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="RMESrJic_6vI46yKRah1-1">
