        <mxCell id="ES_GL0afv2txDs0_LOvH-0" value="&lt;b&gt;Evento:&lt;/b&gt; Seleção do contrato&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gatilho:&lt;/b&gt; Cliente informa o contrato que deseja portar&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Origem:&lt;/b&gt; Canal digital Proponente&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Casos de uso:&lt;/b&gt; Cliente deseja portar o crédito para a instituição proponente&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resposta:&lt;/b&gt; Confirmação de recebimento da solicitação e prazo estimado para análise&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Destinatário:&lt;/b&gt; cliente&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Premissa da notificação:&lt;/b&gt; Em casos de análise assíncrona, é essencial informar o prazo estimado para conclusão e apresentação da nova proposta.&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Evento&lt;/b&gt;: Problemas no processo&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gatilho&lt;/b&gt;: Erro durante o processo de portabilidade&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Origem&lt;/b&gt;: Canal digital Proponente e Credora&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Casos de uso&lt;/b&gt;: Interrupção do processo devido a erro&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resposta:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Notificação de erro e instruções para resolução&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Destinatário&lt;/b&gt;: cliente&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Premissa da notificação:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Não exibir erros no formato 4xx, 5xx (ex.:403, 404, 409 e 422).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 18px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify; min-height: 15px;&quot; class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;color: windowtext; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: transparent; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none;&quot; class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW131608479 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: windowtext; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot; class=&quot;EOP SCXW131608479 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:2148}&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; text-align: justify; background-color: initial; white-space-collapse: collapse;&quot;&gt;Obs.: A API deve retornar o erro, que deve ser interpretado e, se necessário, exibido ao cliente com uma mensagem clara.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="eQ8IaVFmMQ9UTdjSgp4V-1">
