        <mxCell id="_P1LAo1GR8URVJNVYQZT-0" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillStyle=solid;fontSize=18;arcSize=5;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=default;opacity=20;" parent="BV-Vqst7eXZe00izmbX2-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="236" y="1040" width="998" height="353" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BV-Vqst7eXZe00izmbX2-13" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;1.﻿ Verificação de solicitação em andamento:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;- Deve-se verificar se já &lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;existe um pedido de portabilidade em andamento&lt;/b&gt; para o CPF, seja pelo fluxo da registradora ou pelo fluxo do Open Finance.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;- Essa verificação &lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;deve ocorrer automaticamente&lt;/b&gt; antes de permitir qualquer nova solicitação.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;2. Mensagem de alerta:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;- Se um pedido de portabilidade em andamento for identificado, o contrato &lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;será exibido ao cliente com a tag &quot;Portabilidade em andamento&quot;&lt;/b&gt;, indicando que já existe uma solicitação para o contrato em questão e que uma nova solicitação não pode ser feita&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;3. Bloqueio de nova solicitação:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;- Caso exista uma solicitação em andamento, &lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;não deve ser permitido&lt;/b&gt; que o cliente prossiga com uma nova solicitação para o mesmo contrato.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;4. Permissão para nova solicitação:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;- Se &lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;não houver um pedido de portabilidade em andamento&lt;/b&gt;, todos os contratos de CPC devem ser exibidos, permitindo que o cliente selecione qualquer um para dar continuidade ao processo de solicitação de portabilidade.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;spacingLeft=5;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=16;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;arcSize=5;" parent="BV-Vqst7eXZe00izmbX2-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="236" y="1060" width="995" height="342" as="geometry" />
