        <mxCell id="IdeM4RK6fIObJxJEpml0-2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Evento: &lt;/b&gt;Análise da proposta&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gatilho:&lt;/b&gt; Proposta de portabilidade recebida&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Origem:&lt;/b&gt; Canal digital Proponente&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Casos de uso:&lt;/b&gt; Cliente realiza avaliação das condições para seguir com o pedido da portabilidade&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resposta:&lt;/b&gt; Confirmação de que a proposta foi aceita e seguirá para os próximos passos&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Destinatário:&lt;/b&gt; cliente&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Premissa da notificação:&lt;/b&gt; Destacar que a proposta apresentada foi aceita e que o processo de formalização do pedido terá continuidade.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Evento&lt;/b&gt;: Problemas no processo&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gatilho&lt;/b&gt;: Erro durante o processo de portabilidade&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Origem&lt;/b&gt;: Canal digital Proponente e Credora&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Casos de uso&lt;/b&gt;: Interrupção do processo devido a erro&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resposta:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Notificação de erro e instruções para resolução&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Destinatário&lt;/b&gt;: cliente&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Premissa da notificação:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Não exibir erros no formato 4xx, 5xx (ex.:403, 404, 409 e 422).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; margin: 0px; text-align: justify; min-height: 15px;&quot; class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;color: windowtext; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: transparent; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word