        <mxCell id="1mxHs8t5TKC8vWPciGip-0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; display: inline !important;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Evento:&lt;/b&gt; Aceite do contrato&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gatilho:&lt;/b&gt; Contrato da nova operação é exibido&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Origem:&lt;/b&gt; Canal digital Proponente&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Casos de uso:&lt;/b&gt; Cliente realiza conferência das informações do contrato&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resposta:&lt;/b&gt; Notificação para aceite do contrato&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Destinatário: &lt;/b&gt;cliente&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Premissa da notificação:&lt;/b&gt; Destacar que para dar continuidade ao pedido de portabilidade, é necessário que leia e aceite as condições contratuais, sinalizando que o valor da parcela pode sofrer alterações (opcional).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; -webkit-text-stroke-width: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;Obs.: Nesta etapa, é importante que o documento (CCB) seja exibido, para que o cliente tenha visibilidade do resumo da nova operação de crédito e do resumo contratual (sugestão: sinalizar que o valor da parcela pode sofrer alterações). O modelo e as cláusulas do documento serão definidos por cada instituição.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; -webkit-text-stroke-width: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; -webkit-text-stroke-width: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;-webkit-text-stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); background-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-