  <diagram name="Contraproposta - Criterios de aceite" id="K17Fx5EFZDoMT13V8sxV">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" background="none" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="OfghkFnbd2u9Cpnd_QIx-0" />
        <mxCell id="OfghkFnbd2u9Cpnd_QIx-1" parent="OfghkFnbd2u9Cpnd_QIx-0" />
        <mxCell id="vH_0N1nGM5YePRjOEvSQ-0" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillStyle=solid;fontSize=18;arcSize=5;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=default;opacity=20;" vertex="1" parent="OfghkFnbd2u9Cpnd_QIx-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-345" y="3506" width="737" height="322" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="OfghkFnbd2u9Cpnd_QIx-16" value="&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;1. O cliente deve &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;receber a contraproposta&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt; da instituição credora &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;em até 3 dias úteis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt; após a aceitação da oferta da instituição proponente.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;2. Se o cliente &lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;não receber&lt;/strong&gt; a contraproposta  ou &lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;não aceitá-la&lt;/strong&gt; dentro desse prazo, a&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt; instituição credora deve comunicar&lt;/strong&gt; à instituição proponente que o pedido de portabilidade pode prosseguir.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;3. Caso o cliente receba a contraproposta, ele deve ter a &lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;opção de aceitá-la ou rejeitá-la&lt;/strong&gt; dentro do mesmo &lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;prazo de 3 dias úteis.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;4. &lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;A comunicação&lt;/strong&gt; entre as instituições deve ser automática e ocorrer &lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;dentro dos prazos estabelecidos&lt;/strong&gt;, sem falhas.&lt;/p&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;spacingLeft=5;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=18;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-15;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="OfghkFnbd2u9Cpnd_QIx-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-345" y="3526" width="717" height="302" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" link="data:page/id,L5f78kHe42aGRitIhAWh" id="OfghkFnbd2u9Cpnd_QIx-19">
